+ *
+ *                Using           :    -upsample FAC
+ *                is equivalent to:    -delta_scale 1.0/FAC
+ *
+ *                Using           :    -downsample FAC
+ *                is equivalent to:    -delta_scale FAC
+ *
+ *                         FAC <= 0.0    : illegal
